The '''Confederal Left''' ({{lang-bl|Ezquierda Confederal}}), is a multi-tendency ("pan-leftist") platform established in [[Balisca]] in the {{W|Post-Cold War era}}, bringing together a variety of left-wing ideologies (ranging from [[W:Democratic socialism|democratic socialists]] [center-left] to [[W:Post-left|post-left]] [[Anarchism in Balisca|anarchists]]) in the [[Confederal Congress]]. 

